  {
   "description": "Set once, via \"Get Items From > Quotation\" -- the only supported way to populate this Indent. Deliberately the source, not Sales Order/Sales Invoice: this app's revenue is the commission on the Indent (see Commission Invoice), never the trade's full value, so Indent doesn't wait on -- or depend on -- whatever happens to the Quotation's own downstream Sales Order/Invoice.",
